    "scientific_verdict": "Conditional CLASSICAL latent-error equality identities only. No physical equality instrument is supplied on phase qubits, and retaining an original error e is not a CNOT sum error law. The posterior-power telescoping identity and SNR_proxy<=survival<=1 are retained. Direct-leaf comparisons are finite diagnostics, not a universal dominance theorem; q3,p2/3 is an exact zero tie, and p0/p1 have neutral gain."
